concrete: the concatenation's gradient scatter is emitted non-initializing: true
concrete: v's projection indexes its width-1 concatenation axis at Fixed_idx 0: true
concrete: v's projection mentions no symbol of the concatenation's component: true
concrete: the initializing scatter writes u with a plain store, never reading it: true
concrete: u gets no init pass: true
concrete: the initializing scatter writes v with a plain store, never reading it: true
concrete: v gets no init pass: true
concrete at extent 3: the reference u gradient is its slice of cat's: true
concrete at extent 3: the reference v gradient is its slice of cat's: true
concrete at extent 3, unscheduled initializing scatter: u equals the reference: true
concrete at extent 3, unscheduled initializing scatter: v equals the reference: true
concrete at extent 3, scheduled initializing scatter: u equals the reference: true
concrete at extent 3, scheduled initializing scatter: v equals the reference: true
symbolic: the concatenation's gradient scatter is emitted non-initializing: true
symbolic: v's projection indexes its width-1 concatenation axis at Fixed_idx 0: true
symbolic: v's projection mentions no symbol of the concatenation's component: true
symbolic: the initializing scatter writes u with a plain store, never reading it: true
symbolic: u keeps an init pass (a symbolic extent is never proven surjective): true
symbolic: the initializing scatter writes v with a plain store, never reading it: true
symbolic: v keeps an init pass (a symbolic extent is never proven surjective): true
symbolic at extent 2: the reference u gradient is its slice of cat's: true
symbolic at extent 2: the reference v gradient is its slice of cat's: true
symbolic at extent 2, unscheduled initializing scatter: u equals the reference: true
symbolic at extent 2, unscheduled initializing scatter: v equals the reference: true
symbolic at extent 2, scheduled initializing scatter: u equals the reference: true
symbolic at extent 2, scheduled initializing scatter: v equals the reference: true
symbolic at extent 4: the reference u gradient is its slice of cat's: true
symbolic at extent 4: the reference v gradient is its slice of cat's: true
symbolic at extent 4, unscheduled initializing scatter: u equals the reference: true
symbolic at extent 4, unscheduled initializing scatter: v equals the reference: true
symbolic at extent 4, scheduled initializing scatter: u equals the reference: true
symbolic at extent 4, scheduled initializing scatter: v equals the reference: true
shared: the initializing scatter accumulates into the shared node, with no plain store: true
shared: the shared node keeps an init pass: true
shared: the reference sums both columns of cat's gradient: true
shared: the initializing scatter equals the reference: true
alias: the initializing scatter accumulates into the shared parent, with no plain store: true
padded: the padded width-1 target gets a plain store and no init: true
padded: its margin is still reset to the padding value: true
